      "excerpt": "# Interconnection procedure note ## Situation You asked who funds a restudy if a peer Interconnection Request (IR) withdraws. This restates BPM-015 r33 and is not a legal opinion. ## Workflow If MISO (the Transmission Provider) determines that a restudy is required due to a peer IR withdrawal before all Generator Interconnection Agreements (GIAs) are executed or filed, MISO shall provide notice of the restudy, including a good faith estimate of the cost to perform the restudy",
