      "excerpt": "MISO (the Transmission Provider) will provide a good faith estimate of the cost to perform the Interconnection Study restudy, and the Interconnection Customer (IC) is responsible for funding the restudy as noticed. The IC must notify MISO within five (5) Business Days whether it wishes to proceed with the restudy or withdraw its interconnection request (IR) (BPM-015 r33 §5.4.6). ## Citations - BPM-015 r33 §5.4.6 - Interconnection Study Restudy (pages 56-56) ## Must not claim ",
